 THEORY                                                             72 1451
 ------                                                             72 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics    72 1451
 (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. The          72 1451
 inelastic scattering thermal scattering law data for uranium       72 1451
 mononitride (UN) was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics    72 1451
 methods [1-2]. The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub         72 1451
 (FLASSH) code was used to produce MF=7 and MT=2 and 4 for U in     72 1451
 UN [2].                                                            72 1451
                                                                    72 1451
 The UN evaluation was improved over the ENDF/B-VIII.0              72 1451
 evaluation with key updates: (1) lattice constants from            72 1451
 experimental values were used [2] and (2) the coherent elastic     72 1451
 (MT2) contribution was updated to the cubic evaluation in          72 1451
 FLASSH [3].                                                        72 1451
